    {
      "id": "quick-answer",
      "type": "quick-answer",
      "title": "Remember These First",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 0,
      "callout": "Azmadi is the Interlude 2 final boss at Qimah Reservoir. The 0.5.2 patch changed how his Dash behaves — old videos showing double hits are out of date.",
      "calloutDetail": [
        "Zarokh stops time during the fight; that window adds telegraphed hazards you must respect.",
        "Since 0.5.2 the Dash no longer double-hits and is not used against melee the same way — reproach old guides.",
        "Red-flash attacks are still high danger; treat them as commitment windows, not guaranteed one-shots."
      ],
      "answers": [
