    {
      "id": "time-stop-mechanic",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Time-Stop Mechanic",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 5,
      "paragraphs": [
        "At low HP Zarokh intervenes and stops time. The arena gains telegraphed hazards you must respect; this is when Azmadi's radial attack (Death from every angle) becomes active.",
        "The time-stop is a repositioning window, not a freeze you can ignore. Read the hazard tells and move before the radial fires."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Zarokh stops time at low HP.",
        "Hazards are telegraphed — read them.",
        "Death from every angle is the radial payoff; respect its wind-up."
      ]
    },
