      "id": "build-considerations",
      "type": "build-considerations",
      "title": "Build Considerations",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 9,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Positioning beats brute force here. Builds that can kite the Dash and respect the radial do well; glass-cannon builds that ignore the time-stop die to Death from every angle.",
        "Melee is viable post-0.5.2 since the Dash no longer double-hits, but must still respect the lunge timing."
      ],
